<title>UK: Royal Sun Q1 op profits rise to 195 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Royal Sun Q1 op profits rise to 195 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>				   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr operating (pence)  8.3		    vs 7.2</p>
<p> General premium income 1,714		  vs 1,882</p>
<p> Long term		  591		    vs 527</p>
<p> General pretax	   135		    vs 111</p>
<p> Pretax oper profit     195		    vs 157</p>
<p> Investment income	218		    vs 229</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast operating pre-tax profits in a range between 170 and 195 million stg. Previous year's figures on proforma basis following Royal Insurance and Sun Alliance merger last May.</p>
<p>Full company name - Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Group Plc</p>
</text>
